              f"- 누적: 검사 {V21390_STATE.get('paper_checked',0)} / 통과 {V21390_STATE.get('paper_passed',0)} / 직접등록 {V21390_STATE.get('paper_manual_inserted',0)} / 차단 {V21390_STATE.get('paper_blocked',0)}", '',
